OL,3,GNEWSAPuffin island on cusp of closure
OL,4,Aas it runs out of water
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamed for its puffins, the
OL,7,Fpicture-perfect island of Lundy
OL,8,Fattracts birdwatchers from all over.
OL,9,FBut the island is on the cusp of being
OL,10,Fevacuated as water levels drop to the
OL,11,Flowest ever, forcing residents to take
OL,12,Fdrastic measures to ensure supplies do
OL,13,Fnot run out.
OL,15,FLocated in the Bristol Channel off the
OL,16,Fnorth Devon coast, the 5km (3.1 mile)
OL,17,Flong island is not the first place you
OL,18,Fexpect to be running out of water.
OL,20,FIt is rich with wildlife including
OL,21,Fpuffins and seals and its rugged
OL,22,Flandscape makes for breathtaking views.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
